    <briefdescription>
<para>Immutable metadata for a project snapshot. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Snapshots are content-addressed: the <computeroutput>checksum</computeroutput> field is the SHA-256 digest of the serialised snapshot content. It is computed at creation time and verified on every restore call. Snapshots are never mutated after creation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
